description: Docker and Database rules
globs: "**/Dockerfile*, **/prisma/*"
alwaysApply: false
---
# Docker Rules
- ALWAYS use multi-stage builds with `node:22-alpine` as the builder and runner image.
- COPY `package*.json` and run `npm ci` BEFORE copying application source code for caching.
- COPY `prisma ./prisma/` and run `npx prisma generate` before copying full source code if Prisma is used.
- NEVER run `npm run dev` in production Dockerfiles. Use `node dist/index.js`.